 "role": "Declares the @Observable @MainActor VoiceConversationController singleton that runs hands-free voice chat (STT -> shared AssistantViewModel -> streaming TTS) during workouts, its typed errors, its State enum (mirrored to the Watch), all its stored tuning constants and state, and the thin forwarding wrappers into VoiceAudioPipeline; also recognizer construction (boot/refreshLanguageForSession).",
