  "VoiceConversationController.State: enum — idle/starting/listening/thinking/speaking/triggerSpeaking with watchLabel strings",
  "VoiceTriggerQueue: struct — the coach triggers queued behind the conversation (capacity 8, oldest dropped); Trigger enum spokenLiteral(String) / aiPrompt(String)"
 ],
