 ],
 "toplevel": "Stored-property initializers: shared singleton built on first access; synthesizer and audioEngine are lazy (synthesizer's closure initializer wires its delegate to self, so construction builds neither); textChunker = SpokenTextChunker() at construction. No explicit init: NSObject's init() is inherited. State conforms to Equatable. The class is @Observable so the UI and the Watch mirror observe state/partialTranscript/currentResponseText/permissionError. VoiceTriggerQueue (declared after the class) holds the queue's array and its cap, so the controller and its extensions go through enqueue/popFirst/removeAll/discardSpokenLines.",
